<title>俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35694</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35694</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:11:38 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。<br/>日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至9.9级，并针对北海道至东海地方几乎全域发布最大震度7的<a href="https://eew-history.dmdata.ne.jp/20261016123810" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">紧急地震速报</a>。约8分48秒后气象厅撤销了紧急地震速报。<br/>此次地震日本实际录得最大震度1，在北海道函馆市。NHK北海道各放送局均未感受到明显摇晃。<br/>此次误报导致东海道新干线一度停运。JR东日本表示，东北新干线和在来线的运行未受此次紧急地震速报影响。<br/>日本气象厅在当地时间14时召开的记者会上表示，正在调查此次误报的详情，并否认系统遭受网络攻击。<br/>（<a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us6000u2mq/executive" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美国地质调查局</a>，NHK <a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60368" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">1</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60369" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">2</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60374" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">3</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/UPynXya5dlJE8fQfb8Z565vHJG0YHS6oosu1fql6AkWX7tGztLmCKIECO1h3o9W3KdC7rKDVWgMPuJU7EstEFp-ou-qHzgCNG-e4HlV9ZRlUkbMdSejmMWQakwxSnmCulrqM5lRs6a0y8jvn2EkTjFhr7U3vMWgF2OPdLwV2BUYNUb5v26O5nLQDTNrB4AQVg_b7ogJUbXJA9XOTUID5RSCNXRlwSgnDGqfN8KlsjDWrs2e1yacGk0t6kU0abOjGe-msDdLuUgRXmp6xlh0zbiN_Zi7JwBJcTnz2yGWBtjzHVDwyYr7bL0Zj2VvLVcrOD2se1xYPjx4BQ9bBc-f7yQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Sp4XijF5T1wxt3TKChRQ9bYEU2o0moUH_eAtJJv6fqT--BCkqCLAP5I4Hnp87nKpP5deiw66yGuBB0raKJIiJORAKkDlPRcNF1dgfl73Oy8xBC9NzBpceqX7ViWAfcCigshHIy3Lv_a2M8-_dy4HsIiIrTlz_cNwqoUNxWm6tz3eAb9db4akMrhTreKTvfnAD67DekPLJhRqdDjagnL15PLD__PqpiOrYBfMb84xbhuzB6B3_DLY_ebY8ZemG2D8I51SbAGHammEj72-rEczYZmgfH9yTXW7RnrYft